@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Mengunggah Format Surat Izin Siswa (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Template ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Presensi Siswa" > "Template Surat Izin"
UI -> C: 2. Request template page
C -> DB: 3. Get existing templates
DB --> C: 4. Return templates data
C --> UI: 5. Load template page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan halaman template surat

== Upload Template Baru ==
TU -> UI: 7. Klik "Tambah Template" / "Tambah Template Baru"
UI -> C: 8. Request form template
C --> UI: 9. Load upload form
UI --> TU: 10. Tampilkan form (nama surat + upload file DOCX)

TU -> UI: 11. Input nama surat + pilih file DOCX + klik "Simpan Template"
UI -> C: 12. Handle form submission

alt Data valid dan file DOCX
    C -> C: 12.1. Validate form data & file format
    C -> DB: 12.2. Save template data & file
    DB --> C: 12.3. Template saved successfully
    C -> DB: 12.4. Get updated templates list
    DB --> C: 12.5. Return updated data
    C --> UI: 12.6. Success response + refresh data
    UI --> TU: 12.7. "Template berhasil disimpan" + tampilkan daftar template
else Data tidak valid / file bukan DOCX
    C -> C: 12.1. Validate form data & file format
    C --> UI: 12.2. Validation error
    UI --> TU: 12.3. Tampilkan pesan error:
    note right
    - "Nama surat wajib diisi"
    - "File harus berformat DOCX"
    - "File tidak boleh kosong"
    end note
end

@enduml